---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { APPS } from '../i18n';
---
<Base
  title="Sunpebble — Privacy Policy"
  description="How the Sunpebble website handles your information, browser preferences, and third-party services, with links to each app's privacy policy."
  doc
>
  <nav><a href="/">← Sunpebble</a></nav>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="date">Effective <time datetime="2026-09-15">September 15, 2026</time></p>

  <h2>About this policy</h2>
  <p>This policy covers the Sunpebble website at sunpebblelabs.com and sunpebble.github.io.
     Our apps have their own privacy policies, linked below, which describe how each app handles your data.</p>

  <h2>Visiting the website</h2>
  <p>You can browse this website without creating an account or submitting personal information.
     We do not add analytics, advertising, or tracking scripts to the website.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2>
  <p>The website does not set cookies. When you choose a light or dark theme, we save that preference
     in your browser's local storage so it is remembered on your next visit. This preference stays
     in your browser and is not sent to us. You can remove it by clearing this website's data in your
     browser settings. Without a saved preference, the website follows your device's theme.</p>

  <h2>Hosting and fonts</h2>
  <p>This website is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub logs visitors' IP addresses for security purposes.
     See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages/getting-started-with-github-pages/what-is-github-pages#data-collection">GitHub Pages data collection</a>
     and the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>
     for details.</p>
  <p>We load fonts from Google Fonts. When your browser requests these fonts, Google receives your
     IP address and information about your browser needed to deliver the fonts.
     See <a href="https://fonts.googleblog.com/2022/11/your-privacy-and-google-fonts.html">Google Fonts' privacy information</a>
     for details.</p>

  <h2>Contacting us</h2>
  <p>If you email us, we receive your email address and the information you choose to include in your
     message. We use this information to respond to your request and provide support. Our email
     provider also processes the correspondence to deliver and store messages. Please only include
     information needed for your request.</p>
  <p>You can contact <a href="mailto:support@sunpebblelabs.com">support@sunpebblelabs.com</a>
     with privacy questions or to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information
     you have shared with us.</p>

  <h2>Links to other services</h2>
  <p>Our website includes links to services such as GitHub and Telegram. If you follow
     a link to another service, its own privacy policy applies to your use of that service.</p>

  <h2>Our apps</h2>
  <p>For information about an app's permissions, storage, sync, and third-party services, read its
     privacy policy:</p>
  <ul>
    {APPS.map((app) => <li><a href={`/${app.slug}/privacy/`}>{app.name}</a></li>)}
    <li><a href="/homekeep/privacy/">Homekeep</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>Updates to this policy will be posted on this page with a new effective date.</p>
</Base>
